{"seq":76,"slug":"time-series-databases","title":"时间序列数据库","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"时间序列数据库\">时间序列数据库</h1><p>当一台服务器的 CPU 利用率、一个传感器的温度读数、一笔交易的延迟毫秒数被一次次打上时间戳记录下来，数据就有了一根天然的主轴——时间。这类「带时间戳、按时间到达、几乎只增不改」的数据，用普通的 MySQL 或 PostgreSQL 硬扛，往往在序列数破百万、行数破百亿时索引爆炸、写入崩塌。时间序列数据库正是为驯服这股数据洪流而生的专用工具。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四章层层递进，带你从原理走到实践。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」是地基：先看清时序数据到底有哪些内在性质——时间戳近等间隔、追加写主导、相邻值高度相关、热度随时间衰减；再理解这些性质为何让专用时序库数量级优于通用数据库；最后建立度量、标签、字段这套贯穿全 hub 的数据模型语言。后面每一个设计取舍，都能在这一章找到根。</p>\n<p>第二章「存储」回答「数据怎么排在磁盘上」：列式与时间分块的布局如何让聚合只扫必要的列、让旧数据整块过期；Gorilla 的 delta-of-delta 与 XOR 编码如何把存储压到十分之一；保留策略与降采样如何让成本随时间收敛而非无界膨胀。</p>\n<p>第三章「查询与摄取」处理数据的进与出：高吞吐摄取如何把随机写转成顺序写、撑起每秒千万点；时序查询如何以时间窗口为中心做聚合、速率、分位数；连续查询与物化如何把昂贵的重复聚合预先算好、增量维护。</p>\n<p>第四章「系统与实践」收口落地：对比 Prometheus、InfluxDB、TimescaleDB 三条技术路线的取舍；剖析高基数这个最致命也最易自伤的故障类型；最后把全部原理放回监控与 IoT 这两个真实战场，看它们如何协同。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是孤岛——文档间用相对链接互相指引，前一章的性质成为后一章的设计动机，构成一张完整的知识网。读完你将不只会用某个时序库，而是理解所有时序库共享的那套底层思想，从而在 2026 年日益常见的异构组合架构里做对每一个取舍。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timeseries-characteristics","title":"时序数据的特征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/foundations/timeseries-characteristics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tsdb-vs-general","title":"时序库与通用数据库之别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/foundations/tsdb-vs-general"},{"seq":3,"slug":"timeseries-data-model","title":"时序数据模型：度量、标签与字段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/foundations/timeseries-data-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"storage","title":"存储","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"columnar-timeseries","title":"列式与时序存储布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/columnar-timeseries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compression-tsdb","title":"时序压缩：Gorilla 与 Delta","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/compression-tsdb"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retention-downsampling","title":"保留策略与降采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/retention-downsampling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"query","title":"查询与摄取","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ingestion-pipeline","title":"高吞吐摄取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/ingestion-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-aggregation","title":"时序查询与聚合窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/query-aggregation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-queries","title":"连续查询与物化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/continuous-queries"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems","title":"系统与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tsdb-products","title":"产品：InfluxDB、Prometheus、TimescaleDB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/tsdb-products"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cardinality-challenges","title":"高基数挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/cardinality-challenges"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monitoring-iot-uses","title":"监控与 IoT 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/monitoring-iot-uses"}]}]}